Moreover,
\begin{align*}
kM + (n-k-j)m &= 0 
kM^2 + (n-k-j)m^2 + (n-j)mM &= 0
\end{align*}
hence
\begin{align*}
\sum_{i=1}^n x_i ^2 &= -(n-j)mM 
\sum_{i=1}^n x_i ^2 &\leq -nmM,
\end{align*}
as desired.

